1 _META <metadataxml><content><line>&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;http://www.acadian-cajun.com/1671cens.htm&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</line><line>&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;1671 Acadian Census&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</line><line>&lt;p&gt;Here is a transcription of th
2 CONC e first Acadian census. If you have been using the transcription from LeBlanc's book, &lt;em&gt;The Acadian Miracle&lt;/em&gt;, you should be aware that there are errors and omissions. This transcription should be more accurate.&lt;/p&gt;</line><li
2 CONC ne>&lt;p&gt;Most of the entries are from Port Royal, though there are a few from other locations: The Habitation of Poboncom near the Island of Touquet, Cap Neigre, and At Rivier aux Rochelois.&lt;/p&gt;</line><line>&lt;p&gt;I also have a graphic c
2 CONC opy of the Original 1671 census at this website.&lt;/p&gt;</line><line>&lt;p&gt;Surnames are linked to the webpage with up to 6 generations of constructed genealogy.&lt;/p&gt;</line><line>&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;PORT ROYAL&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</
2 CONC line><line>&lt;p&gt;Jacob BOURGEOIS, Surgeon, 50; wife Jeanne TRAHAN 40; Children (two married): Jeanne 27, Charles 25, Germain 21, Marie 19, Guillaume 16, Marguerite 13, Francois 12, Anne 10, Marie 7, Jeanne 4; cattle 33, sheep 24.&lt;/p&gt;</line
2 CONC ><line>&lt;p&gt;Jean GAUDET 96, wife, Nicole COLLESON 64; Child: Jean 18, cattle 6, sheep 3.&lt;/p&gt;</line><line>&lt;p&gt;Denis GAUDET, 46, wife, Martine GAUTHIER 62; Children (the first 2 married): Anne 25, Marie 21, Pierre 20, Pierre 17, Mari
2 CONC e 14; cattle 9, sheep 13.&lt;/p&gt;</line><line>&lt;p&gt;Roger KUESSY 25; wife, Marie POIRIER 22; Child: Marie 2; cattle 3, sheep 2.&lt;/p&gt;</line><line>&lt;p&gt;Michel De FOREST 33, wife, Marie HEBERT 20: Children: Michel 4, Pierre 2, Rene 1; ca
2 CONC ttle 12, sheep 2.&lt;/p&gt;</line><line>&lt;p&gt;Marie GAUDET, Widow of Etienne HEBERT, 38, Children (married): Marie 20, Marguerite 19; (not married): Emmanuel 17, Etienne 17, Jean 13, Francoise 10, Catherine 9, Martine 6, Michel 5, Antoine 1; cat
2 CONC tle 4, sheep 5.&lt;/p&gt;</line><line>&lt;p&gt;Antoine BABIN 45, wife, Marie MERCIER 25; Children: Marie 9, Charles 7, Vincent 5, Jeanne 3, Marguerite 1; cattle 6, sheep 8.&lt;/p&gt;</line><line>&lt;p&gt;Olivier DAIGRE 28, wife, Marie GAUDET 20; Ch
2 CONC ildren: Jean 4, Jacques, 2, Bernard 1; cattle 6, sheep 6.&lt;/p&gt;</line><line>&lt;p&gt;Antoine HEBERT, cooper, 50, wife Genevieve LAFRAND 58; Children: Jean 22, Jehan 18, Catherine 15; cattle 18, sheep 7, 6 arpents in 2 places&lt;/p&gt;</line><li
2 CONC ne>&lt;p&gt;Jean BLANCHARD, 60, wife, Radegonde LAMBERT 42; Children (married): Martin 24, Madeline 28, Anne 26; (unmarried): Guillaume 21, Bernard 18, Marie 15; cattle 12, sheep 9.&lt;/p&gt;</line><line>&lt;p&gt;Widow Francois GUDCIN (GUERIN), 26
2 CONC ; Children: Anne 12, Marie 9, Frivoline 7, Huguetta 5, Francois 2; cattle 6, sheep 3, 6 arpents&lt;/p&gt;</line><line>&lt;p&gt;Michel DUPOUT (DUPUIS), 37, wife Marie GAUTEROT 34; Children: Marie 14, Martin 6, Jeanne 4, Pierre 3; cattle 5, sheep 1
2 CONC , 6 arpents&lt;/p&gt;</line><line>&lt;p&gt;Claude TERRIAU 34, wife, Marie GAUTEROT 24; Children: Germain 9, Marie 6, Marguerite 4, Jean 1; cattle 13, sheep 3, 6 arpents&lt;/p&gt;</line><line>&lt;p&gt;Germain TERRIAU 25, wife, Andree BRUN 25; Child
2 CONC : Germain 2; cattle 5, sheep 2, 2 arpents&lt;/p&gt;</line><line>&lt;p&gt;Jean TERRIAU, 70, wife, Perrine RAU 60; Children (married): Claude 34, Jean 32, Bonaventure 30, Germain 25, Jeanne 27, Catherine 21; (not married): Pierre 16; cattle 6, shee
2 CONC p 1.&lt;/p&gt;</line><line>&lt;p&gt;Francois SAVOYE, 50, wife, Catherine LeJEUNE 38; children: Francoise 18, Germain 17, Marie 14, Jeanne 13, Catherine 9, Francoise 8, Barabe 6, Andree 4, Marie 2; cattle 4.&lt;/p&gt;</line><line>&lt;p&gt;Jehan CORP
2 CONC ORON, 25, wife Francoise SAVOIE 18; Child: one daughter of 6 weeks; cattle 1, sheep 1.&lt;/p&gt;</line><line>&lt;p&gt;Pierre MARTIN, 70, wife Catherine VIGNEAU 68; Children (married): Pierre 45, Marie 35, Marguerite 32, Andre 30; (not married): Mat
2 CONC hier 35; cattle 7, sheep 8.&lt;/p&gt;</line><line>&lt;p&gt;Francois PELERIN, 35, wife Andre MARTIN 30; Children: Hugette 5, Marie 2, infant girl 2 days; sheep 1.&lt;/p&gt;</line><line>&lt;p&gt;Pierre MORIN, 37, wife Marie MARTIN 35; Children: Pierr
2 CONC e 9, Louis 7, Antoine 5, Marie 3, Ann 10 months; cattle 3, sheep 4.&lt;/p&gt;</line><line>&lt;p&gt;Mathieu MARTIN, 35; Not married and weaver; cattle 4, sheep 3.&lt;/p&gt;</line><line>&lt;p&gt;Vincent BRUN, 60, wife Renee BRODE 55; Children (marrie
