1 _META <metadataxml><content><line>&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Rotrude of Treves&lt;/strong&gt; (variously spelled Chrotrude, Chrotrud, Rotrude, Chotrude, Chrotude, Chrotrudis), also known as &lt;strong&gt;Rotrou of Treves&lt;/strong&gt;, was born in 690 in Au
2 CONC strasia; died 724, daughter of St. Leutwinus, Bishop of Treves, Bishop of Trier, and Daughter of Chrodobertus II. She married Charles Martel, son of Pepin of Heristal.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;span&gt;Children of Rotrude and Charles&lt;/span
2 CONC &gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;Hiltrud (d. 754), married Odilo I, Duke of Bavaria &lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Carloman &lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Landrade (Landres), married Sigrand, Count of Hesbania &lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Auda, Aldana, or Alane, married Thierry IV, Co
2 CONC unt of Autun and Toulouse &lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Pippin the Younger &lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;</line></content></metadataxml>
