2 CONC d one or two Indians.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;These are listed under Indians from La Hevre and surrounding areas: &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Phillippe Mieusse 48&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Marie his wife 38&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Jacques his son 20 &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Pierre h
2 CONC is son 17&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Francois his son 8&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Philipe his son 5&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Francoise his daughter 11&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Anne his daughter 3&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;</line></content></metadataxml>
