1 _META <metadataxml><content><line>&lt;p&gt;Apr 18, 1983&lt;/p&gt;</line><line>&lt;p&gt;Antoine Dardar &amp;nbsp;Funeral services were scheduled for 1:30 p.m. today at Falgout Funeral Home, Galliano, for Antoine Paul Dardar, 51, a native and resident of G
2 CONC olden Meadow, who died at 2:26 p.m. Saturday in Houma. &amp;nbsp;He was the husband of Thelma Dardar; father of Hanson Dardar Sr., Mrs. Richard (Marie) Scott, Mrs. Michael (Marie) Guebert, Mrs. Michael (Bobbie) Lynder and Mrs. Jimmy (Tammy) Roberts
2 CONC on; brother of Miguel, Homer Jr., Raymond and Summergill Dardar, Mrs. Etienne (Antoinette) Dardar and Mrs. Ebreaux (Arthensie) Dardar Jr. &amp;nbsp;He is survived by seven grandchildren. &amp;nbsp;Arrangements by Falgout.&lt;/p&gt;</line></content>
