2 TITL Isham B Dodson and Rhoda Tuttle Marriage Bond and Permission Note
1 _OID 1089edc0-b78c-4211-8646-469f7ce5fe20
1 DATE 13 Jan 1849
1 PLAC , Wayne, Kentucky, USA
1 _DSCR Isham B Dodson and Rhoda Tuttle Marriage Bond  and Permission Note. Wayne County Marriage Binders, 1849-1852, page 23.
1 _META <metadataxml><cemetery /><transcription>[BOND}
2 CONT Know all men by these presents that we Isham B Dodson and Rolley Dodson are held and firmly bound unto the Commonwealth of Kentucky in the sume of 50 Lbs. current money, the payment of which well and truly to be made, we bind ourselves our heir, i
2 CONC s sealed and dated this 13th day of February 1849.  
2 CONT The conditions of this obligation are sucy that if there shall be no lawful cause to obstruct the intended marriage of Isham B. Dodson and Rhoda Tuttle then this obligaton to by void else remain in full fourse.   [signature]  Isham B Dodson [seal
2 CONC ]  [signature]  Rolly Dodson [seal]  [signature"  Att. Wm Simpson
2 CONT [PERMISSION LETTER]  
2 CONT I do hereby certify that i am willing for Rhoda Tuttle and icom B. Ddoson to marry and authorize the clerk of wayne county ky to give licens [sic] believing that said dodson will treat her well, february the 19 1849  [signature] elizabeth tuttle  [
2 CONC signature]  p. tuttle, witness.</transcription></metadataxml>
