2 CONT 
1 _META <metadataxml><cemetery /><transcription>State of Kentucky, Wayne County.  To any Minister of the Gospel or other person legally authorize by law, you are permitted  to join in the Marriage State James K Powell and Winnifred Dodson, the law having b
2 CONC een Complied with.  Witness, John S Sallee, Clerk of County Court, aforesaid this 1st day of Dec 1869.  [signature] Jno S Sallee, C.W.Co.Ct.
2 CONT 
2 CONT I Certify that on the 19th of Dec'r 1869, I celebrated the rites of Matrimony between James K Powell and Miss Winnifred Dodson in Wayne County, Ky., in the presence of Cosby Simson and Rolly C Dodson.  Given under my hand this 19th day of Decembe
2 CONC r 1869.  [signature] Isaac Powell.    Minester of the Gospel.  M.E.C.S.</transcription></metadataxml>
