2 CONC ong&gt;Caspar Dubs (Toups)&lt;/strong&gt; from the         neighborhood of Zurich,         Switzerland. Protestant; 40         years of age. Butcher and prevot.         His wife; two boys, 10 and 12         years old. Two years on the         place
2 CONC . One and a half arpents         cleared. Three pigs. 1728:         Caspar Dubs married Maria         Barbara Kittler, from         Wurtemberg.1731 : Six arpents         cleared. Caspar Dubs was the         progenitor of all the Toups         famil
2 CONC ies in Louisiana&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;http://genealogytrails.com/lou/1724census.html&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;</line></content></metadataxml>
