2 CONC v style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; color: #707070; font-size: 11px;"&gt;Age 42&lt;/div&gt;</line><line>&lt;div style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-weight: bold;"&gt;Birth of Jean (John) Melanson dit LaVerdure&lt;/div&gt;</line><line>&lt;div sty
