2 CONC x 15px; padding: 0px; line-height: 17px;"&gt;According to Stephen White, Dictionnaire Genealogique des Familles Acadiennes, published 1999, there isn&amp;rsquo;t a specific birth year that can be attributed to Germain. It is unknown where the earl
