2 CONC <line>&lt;p style="margin: 10px 0px 15px; padding: 0px; line-height: 17px;"&gt;Again, according to Stephen White, Germain was born at Couperans en Brie or Conflans en Brye. Researcher/Genealogist F. Ren&amp;eacute;; Perron, of S&amp;egrave;vres, Fr
