1 _META <metadataxml><content><line>&lt;p&gt;&amp;quot;Mr Emile Angelette and his wife Marie Perrin just barely survived the storm, but their 5 children and all their possessions were lost.&amp;nbsp; Mrs Angelette&amp;#39;s long hair became entangled in th
2 CONC e branches of a tree and this probably saved her life.&amp;nbsp; They finally resettled near Golden Meadow and had an additional 9 children.&amp;nbsp; The descendents still maintain the old home site and a tomb at Cheniere Caminada.&amp;quot;&lt;/p
2 CONC &gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;u&gt;Cheniere Caminada-Buried At Sea&lt;/u&gt; Dale P. Rogers 0-937920-03-7 p19&lt;/p&gt;</line></content></metadataxml>
