1 _META <metadataxml><content><line>&lt;font face="Courier New"&gt;I have a correction to what I said earlier.. it was believed by some&lt;br&gt;genealogists that Pierre Melanson dit Laverdure came from Scotland however,&lt;br&gt;Stephen White states tha
2 CONC t he was a french protestant who married in exile in&lt;br&gt;England to an english woman names Priscilla. He was brought to Acadia with&lt;br&gt;his family by Thomas Temple spring of 1657. &lt;br&gt;After the treaty of Breda, he moved to Boston wi
2 CONC th his wife and their youngest&lt;br&gt;son. Two other sons were married to Acadian women and they remained in&lt;br&gt;Acadia.. from them descend the Melansons...&lt;/font&gt;</line></content></metadataxml>
