2 CONC anks.&lt;/p&gt;       &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Odonar&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;or Odomir          was King of Franks who died in 128.&amp;nbsp; He was father of &lt;strong&gt;Marcomir&lt;/strong&gt;,          King of Franks.&lt;/p&gt;       &lt;p&gt;&
