2 CONC pe: circle"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Peter GUTH&lt;/strong&gt;,&lt;sup&gt;28&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;sup&gt;,85&lt;/sup&gt; son of &lt;strong&gt;Hans GUTH&lt;/strong&gt; and &lt;strong&gt;MARIGNONS&lt;/strong&gt;, was born in 1525 in Ottenbach, Zurich, Switzerland.
2 CONC &lt;sup&gt;&lt;sup&gt;28&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;/sup&gt; &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="margin-: 1in"&gt;Peter married &lt;strong&gt;Adelheit TOGGWEILER&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;sup&gt;28&lt;/sup&gt; on 14 June 1551 in Ottenbach, Zurich, Switzerland.&lt;sup&gt;28&lt;/su
2 CONC p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="margin-: 1in"&gt;Marriage Notes: Reference Number:58329&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="margin-: 1in"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Children from this marriage were:&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="margin-: 1in"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&
