2 CONC e of John F. Hoffman, Feb. 28, 2002: Marriage date Oct 1, 1570&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="margin-: 1in"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Children from this marriage were:&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="margin-: 1in"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&am
2 CONC p;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;i.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Heinrich GUTH&lt;/strong&gt; was born on 29 March 1572 in Ottenbach, Zurich, Switzerland and died on 25 October 163
2 CONC 9 in Ottenbach, Zurich, Switzerland at age 67. &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="margin-: 1in"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;ii.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Ludw
2 CONC ig GUTH&lt;/strong&gt; was born in 1573 in Ottenbach, Zurich, Switzerland. &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="margin-: 1in"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;iii.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp
2 CONC ;&lt;strong&gt;Heinrich GUTH&lt;/strong&gt; was born on 24 June 1576 and died on 17 February 1614 at age 37. &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="margin-: 1in"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp
2 CONC ;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;iv.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Elsbeth GUTH&lt;/strong&gt; was born on 3 November 1578. &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="margin-: 1in"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&am
