1 _OID 46f6fa48-7c3a-43ca-ad94-5be9707dda11
1 _META <metadataxml><content><line>&lt;p&gt;From the book "Cheniere Caminada--Buried At Sea" by Dale P. Rogers (1981) - Joseph Perin and his brother were both in the prime of youth and were sea-hardened, strong swimmers.&amp;nbsp; They were both sent fa
2 CONC r out into the Gulf with little to hold on to.&amp;nbsp; When the winds weakend they managed to find debris to rest on and finally they made it to shore and safety.&amp;nbsp; They were tested to the very limit of their strength and endurance and ju
2 CONC st barely survived.&lt;/p&gt;</line></content></metadataxml>
