2 CONC e to Louisiana 3 June 1721 with wife and two oldest children.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;Etienne (Gaspard and Marie Barbe Kettlere) native of this parish, marries Marie Berenhart, April 14, 1754 wittness Michel Behrenhardt the bride
