2 CONC f New Orleans Sacremental Records.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Jean Baptiste son of Andrea and Marguerite Edelmayer Native of St. Charles Parish on the German Coast, married Marguerite Edelmayer Feb 21, 1786 widow of Vincent Lorca, and Joseph Martinez,&amp;n
2 CONC bsp; at St. Louis Cathedral (SLC, M5, 46)&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;shown in Bk4 Woods, Archdiocese of New Orleans Sacremental Records pg 27 placed incorrectly under name of Bernard.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;</line></content></metadataxml>
