2 TITL Bourgeous Family among the early Acadian Settlers (1632)
1 _OID 7dcf6273-f7db-472e-bcde-da97b40b2f6c
1 _META <metadataxml><content><line>&lt;span style="font-family: 'Comic Sans Ms';"&gt;The first Bourgeois in North America was Jacques, who came to Acadie in 1632, probably with his brother-in-law, Germain Doucet dit Laverdure. The two men were most likel
2 CONC y officers in the contingent of soldiers who came to the colony with Isaac de Razilly, who retook Acadie from the English in the name of the King of France in 1632.&lt;/span&gt;</line><line>&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'comic sans ms';"&gt
2 CONC ;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</line><line>&lt;span style="font-family: 'Comic Sans Ms';"&gt;With de Razilly, he first settled at La H&amp;egrave;ve, on the southern coast of present day Nova Scotia. In 1636, after the death of Razilly, the new governor
2 CONC , Charles de Menou d'Aulnay abandoned La H&amp;egrave;ve and re-established the colony at Port Royal to the northwest.&lt;/span&gt;</line><line>&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'comic sans ms';"&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</line><line>&lt;spa
2 CONC n style="font-family: 'Comic Sans Ms';"&gt;One of Jacques' sons, Robert, either came with his father to Acadie or else joined him later. Jacques would later serve as lieutenant of the garrison at Port Royal under Germain Doucet. Robert Bourgeois wa
2 CONC s also an officer of the garrison.&lt;/span&gt;</line><line>&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'comic sans ms';"&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</line><line>&lt;span style="font-family: 'Comic Sans Ms';"&gt;Another son of Jacques, also named Jacques
2 CONC , was born in 1621 in France at La Ferte-Gaucher, church parish of Saint-Romain. Ren&amp;eacute; Perron, a French Acadia genealogist says that Jacques was born there on Jan. 9, 1621, the son of Jacques and Marguerite Bourgeois.&lt;/span&gt;</line><
2 CONC line>&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'comic sans ms';"&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</line><line>&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'comic sans ms';"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'comic sans ms';"&gt;URL: http://acadian.org/bourgeoi.html&l
2 CONC t;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</line><line>&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'comic sans ms';"&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</line></content></metadataxml>
