2 TITL Directions to the Dameron Family Cemetery
1 _OID 7fa169d3-8d25-4c1c-af16-5a13db98fe38
1 DATE 2011
1 PLAC Cairo, Randolph, Missouri
1 _DSCR Directions to the burial place of Leonard L Dodson and Jemima Rogers Dodson, Margarect C. Dodson Baker, West H Baker, Rhoda Dodson Chitwood, Elizabeth Jane Dodson, Margaret F. Dodson, Rolly G Dodson  
1 _META <metadataxml><content><line>&lt;p&gt;The following is a message I received from the lady on findagrave.com who recorded the Dameron Family Cemetery in reply to an inquiry about how to find the Cemetery.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;There are at lea
2 CONC st 41 others buried here. &amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Nancy M...&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;RE: Directions to Dameron Family Cemetery&amp;nbsp; &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Hi Brenda,&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; &lt;/p&gt;&
2 CONC lt;p&gt;This Dameron Cemetery is in T54 R14 S3 west off CR 1390 south of Rt Z, west of Cairo. I would try to give better directions, but it is waaaayyy back off the county road. The landowners took me back there on their Gator, and I doubt even a p
2 CONC ickup could be driven to it. You&amp;#39;re right about it needing attention, but I doubt anyone ever will do anything to it. It&amp;#39;s not readily accessible since the old road closed decades ago, and not many know it&amp;#39;s even there. I wa
2 CONC s told it was vandalized a long time ago, and possibly some stones either stolen or moved to other cemeteries. I also have no doubt there are more stones out of sight in all the brush and leaf litter...&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p
2 CONC &gt;Thanks,&amp;nbsp; &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Nancy&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Dodson&amp;#39;s who are buried here are Leonard L Dodson 1805-1874, Jemima Rogers Dodson 1809-1874, Margaret C Dodson Baker 1841-1924 daughter of Leonard and Jemi
2 CONC ma, her husband West H Baker 1832-1906, Rhoda Dodson Chitwood 1830-1907 daughter of Leonard and Jemima, Elizabeth Jane Dodson 1835-1849 daughter of Leonard and Jemima, Margaret F. Dodson 1855-1857 daughter of George R Dodson and Sarah Louise Damero
2 CONC n, and Rolly F Dodson 1838-1839 son of Leonard and Jemima&lt;/p&gt;</line></content></metadataxml>
