1 _DSCR FROM GENEALOGY OF THE DESCENDANTS OF John Walker WIGTON Sr. SCOTLAND, WITH RECORDS OF A FEW ALLIED FAMILIES.. 1600-1902. Emma Siggins White, Index # 4083  Pages 591/592  http://archive.org/stream/genealogyofdesce00inwhit#page/n5/mode/2up
1 _META <metadataxml><content><line>&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'courier new courier monospace','serif'; mso-bidi-font-family: arial;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: medium;"&gt;Elvira Margaret Walker Houston; born 1804. She married Dr. J. J. Moor
2 CONC man. They adopted Ella M. Houston, who was a daughter of John Davies Houston. Dr. Moorman was a member of the Virginia Legislature, an elder in the Salem Church and the author of several books. Elvira Margaret Moorman was considered bv all who kne
2 CONC w her as a very superior woman, very religious. Her husband was resident physician at White Sulphur Springs for about 40 years. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</line><line>&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;</line></content></metadataxml>
