2 TITL Francois Marie Babin and Marie Heuze b Fr Acadian exiles descendants come to La
1 _OID 91d2f62d-f44f-4288-adbd-c69c55ca7a0a
1 _META <metadataxml><content><line>&lt;p&gt;1766-Francois Babin, n 16 Nov 1766 St-Servan,&amp;nbsp;son of (Simon Babin and&amp;nbsp; Anastasie Terriot from Grand Pre, Acadia, Nova Scotia)&amp;nbsp;parents sent to Southampton, England in 1755 Acadian Gran
2 CONC d Derangement. Imprisoned for 8 years in England. Sent to France where Simon and Anastasie died. succession and inventory for Francois Marie Babin 4 Sept 1816(Thibodaux Courthouse Succession 1816)&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;1785- 29 July 1785 on Le Bon Pap
2 CONC a Francois Marie Babin&amp;nbsp; age 6, arrives in Louisiana from France with sister Marie Babin who&amp;nbsp;married Louis Stievens p 9 &lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;Acadian Families in Exile 1785&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; by Rev Hebert&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;
2 CONC 1785- 29 July 1785 the ship Le Bon Papa Cecile Bourg widow of Ignace Heuze (Use) arrives in Louisiana from France age 48, with son Pierre age 24, Charles age 22, Jean Baptiste age 17, Gregoire age 9, Anne Marie Heuze age 20. p 5 &lt;strong&gt;&lt;u
2 CONC &gt;Acadian Families in Exile&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;1785 &lt;/u&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;by Rev Hebert&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;1759-note: Ignace Heuze&amp;nbsp; (&amp;nbsp;first to Marie Josephe Renaud who died in Acadian Grand Derange
2 CONC ment) married Cecile Bourg in 1759, (Cecile was the widow of Joseph Longuespee who died in Acadian Grand Derangement). Family #117 in Chatelleraut, France refugeee camp, family #559 in St. Malo, Fr refugee camp, family # 182 in Nantes, France refug
2 CONC ee camp &lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;Acadian Families in Exile&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; in Nantes, Chatellerault, and St. Malo by Albert Robichaux Jr. &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;31 Dec 1786 at St. Gabriel, Louisiana married &lt;stron
2 CONC g&gt;&lt;u&gt;Anne Marie Use&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; (Heuze) daughter of (&lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;Ignace and Cecile Bourg Acadians in exile)&amp;nbsp;born 1 Feb 1764 St. Servan, France&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
2 CONC &lt;p&gt;1810-&lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;Anne Marie Use&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; wife of Francois Marie Babin noted as a widow, living with children in Lafourche Interior on township15 south, range 18 east section 12 claim #393 with 243.97 sup acres bo
2 CONC unded above by Alexandre Millet. This land was the original claim by Marie Babin.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;children: &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;1787-&lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;Marie Magdeleine&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; b 10 Oct 1787 , baptised 10 May 1788, married&amp
2 CONC ;nbsp; 1 Feb 1807 in Donaldsonville, Ascension Parish, La., &lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;Jacques LeCompte&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; born 25 Aug 1784 Donaldsonville, Assumption Parish, La., son of (&lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;Jacque LeCompte and Marthe Marie&am
2 CONC p;nbsp; Leblanc&amp;nbsp;, daughter of Etienne Leblanc&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;)&amp;nbsp;and married Eugene Toups 6 Oct 1819: children: Francois Lecompte b 2 Apr 1808; Marie Modeste Lecompte 12 May 1810&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;1789-Anne Emelie Babin b 1
2 CONC 1 Dec 1789&amp;nbsp; baptised 27 Jun 1790 PCP -7,36, d bef 1832 married&amp;nbsp; 12 Sept 1810 in Plattenville, Assumption Parish, &amp;nbsp;La., Francois Robichau b 1786&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;1793- Marie Scholastique b 24 Feb 1793, bpt 18 De
2 CONC c 1795 Plattenville, Assumption Parish (ASM-1,57) married Eugene Toups on 26 May 1816 in St. James Parish, La. Died abt 1817, Eugene married her sister on Oct 6, 1819 to Marie Magdeleine Babin widow of Jacques Lecompte.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;1797-Jea
2 CONC n Baptiste 15 July 1797 born bpt 28 May 1798 Plattenville, Assumption Parish (ASM-1,109) married 4 Nov 1828 to Aglae Gisclair (Thib church, v1/243)&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;1799-Francois&amp;nbsp;5 Oct 1799&amp;nbsp; born, bapt 3 May 1800 Plattenville, As
2 CONC sumption Parish (ASM-1,163) married to Euphrosyne (Eliza Frosine) Martin 18 Feb 1822 (Thib Ch v1/23)&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;1803- Raphael Edward b 19 Jan 1803 bpt 21 Nov 1803 Plattenville, Assumption Parish (ASM-6,13)&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;1792-&lt;strong&g
2 CONC t;&lt;u&gt;Francois Auguste Babin&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; b 24 Jan 1792 son of (Francois Marie Babin and Anne Marie Use ) d 26&amp;nbsp;Oct 1872 Raceland, La., &lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;married&amp;nbsp; 11 Feb 1822&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;stron
2 CONC g&gt;&lt;u&gt;Justine Toups&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; b abt 1795 the daugther of (&lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;Andre Toups and Marie Dervain&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;)&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; children of Francois Auguste and Justine Toups: Marie Just
2 CONC ine bap 18 July 1822 Thibodaux, Lafourche, La. Thibct.Hse vl 4/46 to&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; Francoise Robichaux; Eliza Babin b abt 1824 married 8 May 1845 Thibodaux, Eugene Pertuit (Thib,Ct. Hse Vl 4/30); Toussaint Marcellin Babin, n 01 No
2 CONC v 1825 Thibodaux married Carmelite Grabert b abt 1826 married 27 Apr 1846 Thibodaux, La.; remarried to Marie Ernestine Landry in St. Mary&amp;#39;s Raceland, Lafourche, La. 27 Feb 1854; Scholastique records b or bpt 22 April 1828 (Thib ch. v 2/1360
2 CONC ) married 28 May 1846&amp;nbsp;to Louis Martin; Auguste b 20 Dec 1830 married 19 Mar 1855 Emelia Walker (St Marys, Raceland Ch v 1p 75) remarried 9 Aug 1858 to Evariste Bernard; Seraphine&amp;nbsp; 22 Mar 1832 (Thib Ch v2/2220); Marceline b 6 Marc
2 CONC h 1834 (ThibCh v 3/345); married 23 Feb 1852 Evariste Grabert; Justin b 2 Feb 1837 (Thib Ch v3/1300) married 17 Jan 1866 to Alexina Laneuville (Thib Cths.v6/9); Emelie married 6 Sept 1858 to Valfroid Robichaux (Thibcthse v10/63); Amedee b 20 Mar 18
2 CONC 38 (Thib ch v3/1538) married 30 Nov 1858 to Zulema Folse (ThibCths v10/74); Aurelie b 24 Feb 1841 (Thibchv3/2350)&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;u&gt;The 12 children of&lt;strong&gt; Toussaint Marcellin Babin son of Francois Aug
2 CONC uste Babin and Justine Toups&lt;/strong&gt;, grandson of Francois Babin and Marie Uzee (Heuze) who married first at age 20 to Carmelite Grabert&amp;nbsp;daughter of (Jacques Sr and Celeste Autin )(Thib Ct hse Mar v5, #23) &amp;nbsp;and second marri
2 CONC ed Marie Ernestine Landry daughter of (Pierre and Melicere Bourgeois )27 Feb 1854 (Raceland Ch v1, p86) (Thib cthse Mar v8 #12 A)&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;u&gt;Toussaint Marcellin son of (Auguste Babin and Justine Toups)&amp;nbsp;married&amp
2 CONC ;nbsp; 27 April 1846 Carmelite Grabert daughter of (Jacques Sr. and Celste Autin ) (Thibodaux cthse Mar bk 5 #23)children from first wife:&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;u&gt;Auguste Babin son of Toussaint Marcellin and Carmelite Grabert )b 10 Ma
2 CONC y 1847 (Thib.Ch v 5/28) married Ermine Champagne b 1854 married 14 Feb 1874 (Thibodaux Courthouse Mar v 18, #70);&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;u&gt;Anastasie Babin daughter of Toussaint Marcellin and Carmelite Grabert) &amp;nbsp;b 14 April 184
2 CONC 9 Thib ch v5 p 76)&amp;nbsp;&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;u&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Toussaint Marcellin&lt;/strong&gt; son of (Auguste Babin and Justine Toups) married &lt;strong&gt;27 Feb 1854&lt;/strong&gt; &amp;nbsp;when widowed&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&
2 CONC gt;Marie Ernestine Landry&amp;nbsp; daughter of (Pierre and Melisere Bourgeois ) ( Raceland Ch v1, p86) (Thibodaux Cthse Mar v 8, #12A)&lt;/strong&gt;: children:&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;u&gt;Eulalie Uranie Babin&amp;nbsp; b 18 Oct 1855 Race
2 CONC land, Lafourche, La.; &lt;/u&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;u&gt;Marie Phrosine Babin b 29 July 1858 married 23 Feb 1878 in Thibodaux, Adam Blanchard b 1853;&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;u&gt;&amp;nbsp;Pierre Frozin b 16 Nov 1862 Raceland, Lafourche
2 CONC , La. bpt 8 Jan 1863; died 5 Dec 1950 married 7 Feb 1890 St Mary, Raceland to Marguerite Celemee Dufresne, (Raceland Ch bpt bk v4, p377)&amp;nbsp;(Thibodaux&amp;nbsp; Ct Hse Mar v30, #40) Marguerite Dufresne was&amp;nbsp;b 14 March 1868 and died 1
2 CONC 8 nov 1826; &lt;/u&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;u&gt;Joseph Babin bpt&amp;nbsp;14 Jan 1865 Raceland, d 15 Jan 1865 Raceland, Lafourche, La.;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;u&gt;Marie Meloe Babin, n 20 Feb 1867 Raceland married&amp;nbsp; 1
2 CONC 7 Jan 1884 Onesippe Dufrene, son of (Joseph and Adelia Bourgeois)&amp;nbsp;n ca 1859,&amp;nbsp; (Raceland bpt bk v4 p326) (Thibodaux Cthse Mar v25#10) &lt;/u&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;u&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Joseph Melous Babin&lt;/strong&gt;
2 CONC , born&amp;nbsp; 06 Jul 1869 Raceland, Lafourche, La. bpt 15 July 1869&amp;nbsp;(St. Marys Raceland Church, Original bk) married to&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Lucie Verdun&lt;/strong&gt;, b abt 1880, m 14 Feb 1901 ( Raceland&amp;nbsp; ch v2 p 143) (Thi
2 CONC bodaux Courthouse Mar v41 , #52)&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;u&gt;&amp;nbsp;Hypolite Amadeo Babin, b 15 Dec 1871, Raceland, Lafourche, La. marrried 17&amp;nbsp; Sep 1894 to Alice Martin b 1874 ; &lt;/u&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;u&gt;Marcellin m
2 CONC arried 11 Jan 1900 Angelle Champagne (Raceland ch v2, p 108) ( Thibodaux Courthouse Mar v39, #11); &lt;/u&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;u&gt;Ernestine Therese b 11 Mar 1882&amp;nbsp; (Raceland ch v3, p125) married Clovis Diaz&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&g
2 CONC t;&lt;u&gt;&amp;nbsp;Norrine or Honorine born 28 Feb 1875 Raceland, Lafourche, La.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</line></content></metadataxml>
