2 CONC s La Verdure on line 6.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br style="font-family: tinos; font-size: medium; line-height: normal;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: tinos; font-size: medium; line-height: normal;"&gt;Charles Melanson (Pierre La Verdure) was born 1643 i
