1 _META <metadataxml><content><line>&lt;p&gt;25 Aug 1784- b Jacques Lecompte son of Jacques Lecompte and Marie Leblanc ASC 1-115 died 5 Jan 1819 Thibodaux, Lafourche, La. (Thibodaux courthouse succession year: 1823)&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;1787- born 1 Oct.-Mari
2 CONC e Madeleine Babin daughter of (Francois Marie Babin and Anne Marie Use) grandaughter of Ignance Heuze or Uze. born in St. Gabriel, Iberville Parish, La. died prior to her succession which was 6 Jan 1823 (Thib Ct Hs, succ yr 1823)&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;
2 CONC 1807-Marie Madeleine Babin married 1 Feb 1807, (ASC-2, 148) in Donaldsonville, Ascension Parish, La.,&amp;nbsp;Jacqes Lecompte son of (Jacques Lecompte and Marie LeBlanc) b 25 Aug 1784 in Donaldsonville, Ascension, La. ( ASC 1-115) died 5 Jan 1819
2 CONC , Thibodaux, Lafourche, La ( Thibodaux Courthouse Succession 1823) dated 18 Jan 1823 , family assembly for inventory dated 16 Jan 1823(Thibodaux Cthse Succ: 1823)&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;1819-6 Oct 1819 married Eugene&amp;nbsp;Toups, ( Thibodaux courthou
2 CONC se Mar v1, #5)&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;son of (Andre Toups and Marie Dervain) b abt 1783, widower of Scholastique Babin&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;children of Jacques Lecompte and Marie Madeleine Babin:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Francois Lecompte b 2 April 1808, Donalds
2 CONC onville, La. age 22, married 14 June 1830 Adele Gisclare, 19 daughter of Jean Pierre and Francoise Mayer) (Thibodaux Courthouse: Mar v2, #27) (check out also Thibodaux Courthouse Mar v1 8B) Donald Hebert had both records down with two different dat
2 CONC es for same people , parents and ages. chidlren: Marie Lecompte b 4 June 1831 (Thibodaux ch v3 #623) married 20 Aig 1849 Apolinaire Robichaux (Houma ch v1 p149); Joseph b 18 March 1833 Thibodaux ch v3 #624); Amilie Clemence b 17 April 1835 (Thib c
2 CONC h v3 #1700); Adele Pauline 21 Sept 1837 Thib ch v3 #1700): Francois b 27 June 1847 (Houma ch v1 p4); Lucien b 9 Feb 1846 (Thib ch v4 #1131) Marcel Augustin b 30 Sept 1841 (Thib ch v4 #24); &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;Marie Modeste Lec
2 CONC ompte&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; b 12 May 1810, Plattenville, La. , age 19 married 28 Feb 1829&lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt; Cre Justin Martin&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; age 21. son of . &lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;(d,Joseph and Marie Charpentier&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/str
2 CONC ong&gt;) : (Thibodaux Cthse Mar v1, #36) &amp;nbsp;Crejustin Martin &lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;died 25 Nov 1815&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; (Thibodaux Courthouse Succession: 1815) child: Mathilde Martin who married Adam Eugene Bourgeois . The grandson o
2 CONC f Marie Modeste Lecompte and son of Mathilde Martin and Adam Maxmillian Bourgeois was Pierre Allain Bourgeois the father of Paul Bourgeois. Paul Bourgeois maried Therese Babin. &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Eugenie Lecompte 7 Jan 1817, Plattenville, Assmption
2 CONC ,&amp;nbsp;La.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Delphin Lecompte b abt 1815, Plattenville, Assumption, La, married to Clemence Fanguy died Aug 1851 in Houma, Terrebonne, La. (Houma Courthouse Succession #339) children: Delphin b 30 June 1849 (Houma ch v2 p36); El
2 CONC ise Emee b 7 Sept 1841 (Thib ch v3 #3143); Marguerite Azelie b 5 May 1843 (Thib ch v4 #326); Marie Marcelite b 21 Sept 1844 (Thib ch v4, #667)&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Virginie daughter of Jacques and Marie Madeleine Babin) married 25 April 1855 to Miche
2 CONC l Bellanger son of (Hubert and Sophie Comeaux)&amp;nbsp;(Houma Ch v2, 8)&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;children: of Eugene Toups son of (Andre Toups and Marie Dervain&amp;nbsp;) married to Marie Madeleine Babin&amp;nbsp; 6 Oct 1819 (Thib cthse Mar v1 #5) daugh
2 CONC ter of (Francois Marie Babin and Anne Marie Heuze)&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Eugene Aurelien Toups b 11 Oct 1819, Thibodaux, Lafourche, La. (ThibodauxCh v2 p7)&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Zelite Toups, born 3 June 1822 Thibodaux, Lafourche, La. (Thibodaux ch v2 #730
2 CONC )&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;*****************************************************************************************************&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Note: Eugene Toups and Justine Toups are siblings, children of Andre Toups and Marie Dervain&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&
2 CONC gt;****************************************************************************************************&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Francois Auguste Babin b 24 Jan 1792 son of (Francois Marie Babin and Anne Marie Heuze, Uze)&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;1822- 18 Feb 18
2 CONC 22 in Thibodaux, Lafourche, La (Thib Ch v1p24) married&amp;nbsp; Justine Toups daughter of (Andre Toups and Marie Dervain)&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;children: &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;1822- Marie Justine Babin b 18 July 1822 in Thibodaux, Lafourche, La. (Thib. C
2 CONC h.: v2, p69) married Francois Robichaux 6 Sept 1845 Thibodaux, Lafourche, La. (Thib Ct hs Mar v4, 46)&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;1824-Eliza Babin born Thib Ct Hs Mar v4, 30)&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;1825-&lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;Toussaint Marcelin Babin son of (Fran
2 CONC cois Auguste and Anne Marie Heuze)&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;born 1 Nov 1825, Thibodaux, Lafourche, La., (Thib. Ch v2 p 168) died 5 April 1912, Raceland, La. children: Melous Babin father of Therese Babin who married Paul Bourgeois&lt;/p&gt
2 CONC ;&lt;p&gt;1828 Scholastique Babin born 22 April 1828, Thibodaux, Lafourche, La. died 16 April 1871, Thibodaux, Lafourche, La. , married Eugene Toups son of (Andre and Marie Dervain)&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;1834-Marceline Babin born 6 March&amp;nbsp; 1834
2 CONC , Thibodaux, Lafourche, La., &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;</line></content></metadataxml>
