1 _META <metadataxml><content><line>&lt;p&gt;On all of the hints/links on Ancestry I have found Count Isaac Remy De Cambrai (Cambray) as POSSIBLY being the son of Raoul"Rudolph" Count of Vermandois and De Cambrai(Cambray).&amp;nbsp; Other links show Raou
2 CONC l as having other children.&amp;nbsp; I wanted to make sure my Tree for Isaac and Raoul were correct so I have continued to research.&amp;nbsp; On the story about Isaac's Parentage it states that Isaac may not have been Raoul's son but rather his s
2 CONC on-in-law.&amp;nbsp; Researched the one daugher listed as Raouls' and it seems to be making more sense.&amp;nbsp; I did a web search and on the geni.com website I found what I think is correct.&amp;nbsp; It shows Isaac married Raouls' daughter, Ber
2 CONC tha de Cambrai, Comtessa de Cambrai and that Isaacs' 3rd marriage.&amp;nbsp; They had two children Arnoul I, Comte de Cambrai and Judith de Cambrai.&amp;nbsp; His 1st wife Mathilde and Isaac had a daughter Berthe de Valenciennes.&amp;nbsp; And fina
2 CONC lly, his 2nd wife Alberade de Hainault and Isaac had a son Lord Jean Lens, of Bousies, AKA Seigneur (Lord) Lens (Des Marets).&amp;nbsp; HE IS MY ANCESTOR!&amp;nbsp; Not able to find true parentage of Isaac YET - so I am still going to link Raoul a
2 CONC s Isaacs' Father but as "RELATED" and not Biological status, until I know for absolute certainty.&amp;nbsp; If anyone knows more than this I hope to hear from them.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;</line></content></metadataxml>
