1 _META <metadataxml><content><line>&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: arial, helvetica;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color: #000080;"&gt;This Census is interesting in that it is a household census in which all households are enumerated. That means t
2 CONC hat there occurs double counting of individuals as married children are enumerated in their parents houses as well as their own; therefore totals are not easily derived. The total number of enumerated individuals seems to be abt 330.&lt;/span&gt;&l
2 CONC t;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</line><line>&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: arial, helvetica;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color: #000080;"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</line><line>&lt;p&gt;&lt;span sty
