2 CONC tle 12, sheep 2.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;</line><line>&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: arial, helvetica;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color: #000080;"&gt;Marie GAUDET, Widow of Etienne HEBERT,&lt;/span&gt;
2 CONC &lt;span style="color: #000000;"&gt; 38, Children (married): Marie 20, Marguerite 19; (not married): Emmanuel 17, Etienne 17, Jean 13, Francoise 10, Catherine 9, Martine 6, Michel 5, Antoine 1; cattle 4, sheep 5.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&
