2 CONC rie 9, Charles 7, Vincent 5, Jeanne 3, Marguerite 1; cattle 6, sheep 8.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;</line><line>&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: arial, helvetica;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color: #000080;"
