1 _META <metadataxml><content><line>&lt;p&gt;1766-Francois Babin, n 16 Nov 1766 St-Servan,&amp;nbsp;son of (Simon Babin and&amp;nbsp; Anastasie Terriot from Grand Pre, Acadia, Nova Scotia)&amp;nbsp;parents sent to Southampton, England in 1755 Acadian Gran
2 CONC d Derangement. Imprisoned for 8 years in England. Sent to France where Simon and Anastasie died. succession and inventory for Francois Marie Babin 4 Sept 1816(Thibodaux Courthouse Succession 1816)&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;1785- 29 July 1785 on Le Bon Pap
2 CONC a Francois Marie Babin&amp;nbsp; age 6, arrives in Louisiana from France with sister Marie Babin who&amp;nbsp;married Louis Stievens p 9 &lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;Acadian Families in Exile 1785&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; by Rev Hebert&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;
2 CONC 1785- 29 July 1785 the ship Le Bon Papa Cecile Bourg widow of Ignace Heuze (Use) arrives in Louisiana from France age 48, with son Pierre age 24, Charles age 22, Jean Baptiste age 17, Gregoire age 9, Anne Marie Heuze age 20. p 5 &lt;strong&gt;&lt;u
2 CONC &gt;Acadian Families in Exile&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;1785 &lt;/u&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;by Rev Hebert&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;1759-note: Ignace Heuze&amp;nbsp; (&amp;nbsp;first to Marie Josephe Renaud who died in Acadian Grand Derange
2 CONC ment) married Cecile Bourg in 1759, (Cecile was the widow of Joseph Longuespee who died in Acadian Grand Derangement). Family #117 in Chatelleraut, France refugeee camp, family #559 in St. Malo, Fr refugee camp, family # 182 in Nantes, France refug
2 CONC ee camp &lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;Acadian Families in Exile&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; in Nantes, Chatellerault, and St. Malo by Albert Robichaux Jr. &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;31 Dec 1786 at St. Gabriel, Louisiana married &lt;stron
2 CONC g&gt;&lt;u&gt;Anne Marie Use&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; (Heuze) daughter of (&lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;Ignace and Cecile Bourg Acadians in exile)&amp;nbsp;born 1 Feb 1764 St. Servan, France&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
2 CONC &lt;p&gt;1810-&lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;Anne Marie Use&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; wife of Francois Marie Babin noted as a widow, living with children in Lafourche Interior on township15 south, range 18 east section 12 claim #393 with 243.97 sup acres bo
2 CONC unded above by Alexandre Millet. This land was the original claim by Marie Babin.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;children: &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;1787-&lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;Marie Magdeleine&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; b 10 Oct 1787 , baptised 10 May 1788, married&amp
2 CONC ;nbsp; 1 Feb 1807 in Donaldsonville, Ascension Parish, La., &lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;Jacques LeCompte&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; born 25 Aug 1784 Donaldsonville, Assumption Parish, La., son of (&lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;Jacque LeCompte and Marthe Marie&am
2 CONC p;nbsp; Leblanc&amp;nbsp;, daughter of Etienne Leblanc&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;)&amp;nbsp;and married Eugene Toups 6 Oct 1819: children: Francois Lecompte b 2 Apr 1808; Marie Modeste Lecompte 12 May 1810&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;1789-Anne Emelie Babin b 1
2 CONC 1 Dec 1789&amp;nbsp; baptised 27 Jun 1790 PCP -7,36, d bef 1832 married&amp;nbsp; 12 Sept 1810 in Plattenville, Assumption Parish, &amp;nbsp;La., Francois Robichau b 1786&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;1793- Marie Scholastique b 24 Feb 1793, bpt 18 De
2 CONC c 1795 Plattenville, Assumption Parish (ASM-1,57) married Eugene Toups on 26 May 1816 in St. James Parish, La. Died abt 1817, Eugene married her sister on Oct 6, 1819 to Marie Magdeleine Babin widow of Jacques Lecompte.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;1797-Jea
2 CONC n Baptiste 15 July 1797 born bpt 28 May 1798 Plattenville, Assumption Parish (ASM-1,109) married 4 Nov 1828 to Aglae Gisclair (Thib church, v1/243)&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;1799-Francois&amp;nbsp;5 Oct 1799&amp;nbsp; born, bapt 3 May 1800 Plattenville, As
2 CONC sumption Parish (ASM-1,163) married to Euphrosyne (Eliza Frosine) Martin 18 Feb 1822 (Thib Ch v1/23)&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;1803- Raphael Edward b 19 Jan 1803 bpt 21 Nov 1803 Plattenville, Assumption Parish (ASM-6,13)&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;1792-&lt;strong&g
2 CONC t;&lt;u&gt;Francois Auguste Babin&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; b 24 Jan 1792 son of (Francois Marie Babin and Anne Marie Use ) d 26&amp;nbsp;Oct 1872 Raceland, La., &lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;married&amp;nbsp; 11 Feb 1822&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;stron
