2 CONC ine bap 18 July 1822 Thibodaux, Lafourche, La. Thibct.Hse vl 4/46 to&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; Francoise Robichaux; Eliza Babin b abt 1824 married 8 May 1845 Thibodaux, Eugene Pertuit (Thib,Ct. Hse Vl 4/30); Toussaint Marcellin Babin, n 01 No
2 CONC v 1825 Thibodaux married Carmelite Grabert b abt 1826 married 27 Apr 1846 Thibodaux, La.; remarried to Marie Ernestine Landry in St. Mary&amp;#39;s Raceland, Lafourche, La. 27 Feb 1854; Scholastique records b or bpt 22 April 1828 (Thib ch. v 2/1360
