2 CONC land, Lafourche, La.; &lt;/u&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;u&gt;Marie Phrosine Babin b 29 July 1858 married 23 Feb 1878 in Thibodaux, Adam Blanchard b 1853;&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;u&gt;&amp;nbsp;Pierre Frozin b 16 Nov 1862 Raceland, Lafourche
