2 CONC k Antiqua, Times New Roman, Times"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;As the LA 3rd Cavalry Regiment&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt; &lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt; &lt;font face="Book Antiqua, Times New Roman, Times"&gt;Aug. 25th, 1864: Clinton, La. &lt;br&gt; Oct. 1st
