2 CONC e 8, Claude 5, Jeanne 3; 20 cattle, 25 sheep, 12 hogs, 35 arpents, 4 guns.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="margin-: 0in; margin-right: 0in; margin-: 0in; margin-bottom: 0.0001pt; font-size: medium; font-family: 'times new roman'; background-color: #99ffcc"&g
