2 CONC ght: 0in; margin-: 0in; margin-bottom: 0.0001pt; font-size: medium; font-family: 'times new roman'; background-color: #99ffcc"&gt;-&amp;nbsp;&lt;em&gt;Second husband&lt;/em&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Capt. William Wright&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;wa
2 CONC s born (unknown), and died (unknown).&amp;nbsp; They were married 18 April 1680 in Boston, Massachusetts.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="margin-: 0in; margin-right: 0in; margin-: 0in; margin-bottom: 0.0001pt; font-size: medium; font-family: 'times new roman
