2 TITL Francois Marie Babin and Anne Marie Use (Heuze)
1 _OID ccafca57-5a91-4f46-b5e3-5ce42c89cddb
1 _META <metadataxml><content><line>&lt;p&gt;b 16 Nov 1766 in St. Servan , France&amp;nbsp;- &lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;Francois Marie Babin&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; son of (Simon Babin and Anastasie Terriot Acadian parents sent to Europe in exile). died ab
2 CONC t 4 Sept 1816 (Thibodaux courthouse Succession 1816)&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Parents Simon Babin and Anastasie Terriot died in exile from Acadian Grand Derangement when sent to Southampton, England 8 years in concentration prison camp, then to France i
2 CONC n strict refugee camps with little freedom of movement.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;1785- &lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;Francois Marie Ba&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;bin brother of &lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;Marie Babin&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; who was married to &lt;stron
2 CONC g&gt;&lt;u&gt;Louis Stievens&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; arrives in Louisiana from France on the ship Le Bon Papa.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;1786- 31 Dec 1786 married at St. Gabriel, La. &lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;Anne Marie Use&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; b 1 Feb 1
2 CONC 764 (Heuze) daughter of &lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;Ignace Use and Cecile Bourg&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; . &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;children Of Francois Marie Babin and Anne Marie Use:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;1803- b Jan 19 1803 Raphael Edward Babin bapt 21 Nov 180
2 CONC 3 at Plattenville, Assumption, La (ASM-1,163)&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;1799- Oct 5, 1799 Francois Babin , bapt 3 May 1800 at Plattenville, Assumption, La (ASM -1,163) Married 18 Feb 1822 (Thibodaux Church Vol 1, p 23) to Euphrosyne (Eliza Froisene) Marti
2 CONC n daughter of (Joseph and Marie Charpentier)&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;1797-July 15, 1797 Jean Baptiste Babin baptised 28 May 1798, in Plattenville, Assumption, La (ASM 1, 109) He married 4 Nov. 1828 to Aglae Gisclair (Thibodeaux Church Vol 1, #243)&lt;/p&
2 CONC gt;&lt;p&gt;1792-Jan 24, 1792 &lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;Francois Auguste Babin&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; baptised on 17 Feb 1793 (ASC-5, 75) Married on 18 Feb 1822 (Thibodeaux Church vol 1- pg 24 to &lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;Justine Toups daughter of Andr
2 CONC e Toups and Marie Dervain, widowed wife of Charles Rome &lt;/u&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;children: Eliza Babin b 1824;, Toussaint Marcelin Babin&amp;nbsp;{&lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;Melous Babin the son of Toussaint Marcelin Babin&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;}&amp
2 CONC ;nbsp;b 1 Nov 1825, d 5 Apr 1912; Scholastique Babin b 22 Apr 1828; Marceline Babin b 6 Mar 1834&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;1789- Dec 11, 1789 Anne Emilie Babin; baptised 27 June 1790 at Pointe Coupee, La. &amp;nbsp;(PCP-7, 36) Anne Emilie married 12 Sept 1
2 CONC 810 in Assumption Parish, Francois Robichaux&amp;nbsp;b 17 Sept 1790.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;1787- 10 Oct 1787 born &lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;Marie Magdeleine&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; and baptised 10 May 1788 at St. Gabriel (SGA, 11, 29 p#101) Married to 1
2 CONC . &lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;Jacques LeCompte&amp;nbsp;son of (Jacques Lecompte and Marie Leblanc)&amp;nbsp;&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;children: Francois Lecompte b 2 Apr 1808; &lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;Marie Modeste Lecompte b.&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&amp
2 CONC ;nbsp; 12 May 1810 married &lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;Cre Justin Martin {Mathilde Martin daughter of Cre Justin married Adam Eugene Bourgeois}&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;; Eugenie Lecompte b 1817 and Delphin Lecompte b 1815; and 2. married brother in law
2 CONC , 6 Oct 1819 &lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;Eugene Toups son of (Andre Toups and Marie Dervain) (Thibodaux Cthse Mar v1 #5)&amp;nbsp;&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;children: Eugene Aurelien b 1819; Zelite Toups b 1822;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;1793-&amp;nbsp; Feb 24, 1
2 CONC 793 &lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;Marie Scholastique Babin&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; ; baptised 18 Dec 1795 in Plattenville, Assumption, La (ASM-1, 57) Married to Eugene Toups on 26 May 1816 at St. James Parish, La. Died abt 1817. Widower &lt;strong&gt;&lt
2 CONC ;u&gt;Eugene Toups son of Andre Toups and Marie Dervain&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;remarried to his sister in law, Marie Magedeleine Babin the widow of Jacques Lecompte on Oct 6, 1819.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;</line></content><
2 CONC /metadataxml>
