2 CONC D, Jul 1763, with father &amp;amp;  brothers; arrived LA 1766, age 16; &lt;u&gt;married&lt;/u&gt;, age 18, (1)Charles &lt;span style="background-color: #ffff00"&gt;MELAN&amp;Ccedil;ON&lt;/span&gt;, son of Jean-Baptiste MELAN&amp;Ccedil;ON  &amp;amp
