2 CONC qs-tidbit goog_qs-tidbit-0"&gt;Abel Joseph LEGENDRE , Sr. was born 4 AUG 1898 in Lockport, LA, and died 26 OCT 1953. He was buried in Lockport, LA.&lt;/span&gt; He was the son of Felicien &amp;quot;Felix&amp;quot; Jules LEGENDRE and Henriette TOUPS
2 CONC . He married Stella Mary LEBLANC 14 JUN 1931 in Pierre Part, LA, daughter of Telesmar Eusebe LEBLANC and Louisa Isabelle CHAUVIN. She was born 9 SEP 1902 in Lockport, LA, and died 17 SEP 2001. She was buried in Lockport, LA. &lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Hi
2 CONC s father, Felicien &amp;quot;Felix&amp;quot; Jules LEGENDRE was born 12 MAR 1860 in Thibodaux, LA. He was the son of Jules Armand LEGENDRE and Adela Marguerite BABIN. &lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;His mother, Henriette TOUPS was born in Lafourche P
2 CONC arish, LA. She was the daughter of Joseph Onezippe TOUPS , Sr. and Marie Elodie GUIDROZ&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Brothers and sisters of Abel LEGENDRE are: i. Laura Mae LEGENDRE was born 29 DEC 1883 in Lockport, LA. She married Alexandre &amp;q
2 CONC uot;Alex&amp;quot; THERIOT 22 AUG 1901 in Lockport, LA, son of Alexandre Lepine THERIOT and Ella Mary DARDEN. He was born 16 JUL 1878 in Raceland, LA. &lt;br&gt;ii. Henry Joseph LEGENDRE , Sr. was born 16 NOV 1887 in Lockport, LA, and died 5 NOV 19
2 CONC 51. He married Rita M. GUIDROZ 8 JUN 1925 in Orleans Parish, LA, daughter of Charles Auguste GUIDROZ and Estelle LOUPE. She was born 3 MAY 1899 in Lockport, LA, and died 1 MAR 2001. &lt;br&gt;iii. Marie Ida LEGENDRE was born 12 MAR 1892 in Lockport
2 CONC , LA. &lt;br&gt;iv. Joseph Armand LEGENDRE was born 21 SEP 1896 in Lockport, LA. &lt;br&gt;v. Clothilde LEGENDRE was born in Lockport, LA. She married Vernon H. ANDRUS 3 OCT 1902, son of Henry Livingston ANDRUS and Gertrude Elizabeth LYONS. He wa
2 CONC s born 16 JAN 1884 in Acadia Parish, LA&lt;br&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/tbody&gt;</line></content></metadataxml>
