1 _OID f215de50-44db-449e-850c-6abc8036b8e6
1 _META <metadataxml><content><line>&lt;p&gt;1766 Francois Marie Babin b 16 Nov 1766 in exile in France,&amp;nbsp;son of (Simon Babin and Anastasie Terriot) of Acadia died 4 Sept 1816 (Thibodaux Courthouse: Succession: 1816)&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;1786- Francoi
2 CONC s Marie Babin son of (Simon and Anastasie Terriot, Acadians sent to Europe in exile&amp;nbsp;)married 31 Dec 1786 St Gabriel, La., Anne Marie Heuze spelled Use in La., Ann Use born 1 Feb 1764 St Servan, France daughter of Acadian shipped in exile t
2 CONC o Europe ( Ignace Heuze and Cecile Bourg of Acadia)&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;1785-Francois Marie Babin arrived in Louisiana&amp;nbsp; with sister Marie Babin and her husband Louis William Stievens&amp;nbsp;on the Le Bon Papa in 1785 p9 &lt;strong&gt;&lt;u
2 CONC &gt;Acadian Families in&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;Exile 1785&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; Rev Hebert&amp;nbsp;. Father and mother died during Acadian Grand Derangement in exile. Anne Marie Heuze traveled also on same&amp;nbsp;ship
2 CONC &amp;nbsp;the Le Bon Papa to Louisiana from exile in Europe.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Succession of Francois Marie Babin Inventory and estimation of property dated 4 Sept 1816 (Thibodaux Courthouse Succession :1816)&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;children: &lt;/p&gt;&
2 CONC lt;p&gt;b 24 Jan 1792 &lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;Francois Auguste&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; ,age 29 marriage license&amp;nbsp;11 Feb 1822 &lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;Justine Toups daughter of (Andre and Marie Dervain)&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;, age 22 (Thib C
2 CONC t Hse: Mar v1, #56) married in church 18 Feb 1822 (Thibodaux Church :v1, p24) widow of Charles Rome&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;b 19 Jan 1803-Edouard, age 14 at death of father (Thibo Ct Hse Succ 1816)&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;b 11 Dec 1789- Emilie, age 27, marrie
2 CONC d Francois Roichaux died 18 Aug 1832 (Thib Cths Succ: 1832) Francois Robichaux son of (d.Jean Baptiste and d Marie Marthe LeBlanc)&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;b 5 Oct 1799 Francois&amp;nbsp;age 21, married 20 Aug 1821 Euphrosyne Martin, age 21, daughter o
2 CONC f ( Joseph and Marie Charpentier) (Thib Cthse Mar v1, #22)&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;b 15 July 1797-Jean Baptiste&amp;nbsp; married 1 Nov 1828 Marie Aglae Gislair age 21 (Thib Cthse mar v1, #19) note he was 18 when father died in 1816. children: Jean Bapti
2 CONC ste Jr b 1829; Francois b 11 July 1832; ---Marie Gislair died in childbirth,&amp;nbsp;11 July 1832 (Thibodaux Courthouse Succ Year 1832)&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;b 10 Oct 1787- &lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;Marie Magdeleine&amp;nbsp;Babin&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/strong&gt
2 CONC ; daughter of (&amp;nbsp;Francois and Marie Uze) married 6 Oct 1819 &lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;Eugene Toups&amp;nbsp; son of (Andre and Marie Dervain) &lt;/u&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;, widower of Colastie Babin (Thib Cthse : Mar v1, #5)&amp;nbsp; second husba
2 CONC nd Marie Magdeleine Babin&amp;nbsp;married 1 Feb 1807&amp;nbsp;in Ascension, La. &lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;Jacques Lecompte&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; b 25 Aug 1784&amp;nbsp; (ASC 1-115)&amp;nbsp;son of (&lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;Jacque&amp;nbsp;Lecompte a
2 CONC nd Marie Marthe Leblanc&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;) died 5 Jan 1819 Thibodaux, La.&amp;nbsp;----Marie Babin wife of Eugene Toups and Colastie Babin: died abt&amp;nbsp;16 Jan 1823 (Thibodaux Ct hse Succ 1823) Petition for assembly of family 16 Jan 182
2 CONC 3 (Thib Ct hse Succ 1823)&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;b 24 Feb 1793- Scholastique Marie at age 18, married 28 May 1846 Louis Martin Jr age 22 yrs (Thibodaux Courthouse Mar v5, #32)&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&
