1 _META <metadataxml><content><line>&lt;pre style="word-wrap: break-word; white-space: pre-wrap;"&gt;Funeral services have been scheduled for 9:45 a.m. Tuesday at Falgout Funeral Home, Lockport , for Vivian Bourgeois Toups, 77, a native of St. Charles an
2 CONC d a </line><line>resident of Lockport who died in Thibodaux Sunday at 4 p.m.&lt;br&gt;</line><line /><line>Religious services have been scheduled for 10 a.m. Tuesday at Holy Savior Catholic Church in Lockport, with interment in the church cemetery.
2 CONC </line><line>&lt;br&gt;</line><line>Visitation has been scheduled from 6-9 p.m. today and at 9 a.m. until funeral time at Falgout Funeral Home.</line><line>&lt;br&gt;</line><line>She was the wife of Fernand Toups; mother of Noel Toups; sister of Le
2 CONC lia Sposito, Mrs. Gilbert (Carrie) Ven Haus, Mrs. Robert (Marie) Le Ray, Mrs. </line><line>Robert (Mabel) Boudreaux, and Felix Bourgeois; daughter of the late Clebert Bourgeois and Lillian Toups Bourgeois. Also survived by two grandchildren.</line>
2 CONC <line>&lt;br&gt;</line><line>Falgout Funeral Home of Lockport is in charge of the arrangements.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;</line><line>&lt;pre style="word-wrap: break-word; white-space: pre-wrap;"&gt;Obituaries of AUGUST 20, 1984 Thibodaux, La
2 CONC fourche Parish, La.</line><line>Daily Comet, Lafourche Parish, La.</line><line /><line>Submitted by: Chris Tidwell, 29 Aug 2014&lt;/pre&gt;</line></content></metadataxml>
