2 CONT 
2 CONT Top banner: Family name.
2 CONT 
2 CONT Bottom banner: Motto.
2 CONT 
2 CONT Crest: Acadian flag. Letter "M". Signatures of Priscilla and sons Charles and Pierre from whom all Melansons/Melançons are descended. Two English roses and three French fleurs-de-lis representing English and French origin.
2 CONT 
2 CONT Designed by: Margaret C. Melanson, 2001
2 CONT 
